the knowledge base us_policies_usda_snap_fy_2024_cola_deductions includes:


% 7 U.S.C. 2012(j) — us:statutes/7/2012/j
the text of "7 USC 2012(j)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2012/j.yaml".

rule snap_household_has_elderly_or_disabled_member with provenance "7 USC 2012(j)":
the snap household of a household has elderly or disabled member if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2008-10-01 <= D
    and the household is a household
    and a number N is the count of each P such that
        a person P is a member of the household
    and a number K is the count of each M such that
        a person M is a member of the household
        and it is not the case that the snap member of M is elderly or disabled
    and N - K > 0.


% us:policies/usda/snap/fy-2024-cola/deductions
the text of "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments" is at "sources/us/policies/usda/snap/fy-2024-cola/deductions.yaml".

% The row in force on the calculation date, of the table's dated versions below.
the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for a household size is an amount if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for the household size from a date N to a date M is the amount
    and N <= D
    and D <= M.

the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for 1 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 198, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for 2 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 198, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for 3 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 198, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for 4 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 208, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for 5 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 244, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for 6 from 2023-10-01 to 9999-12-31 is 279, as stated in "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments".

rule snap_standard_deduction_48_states_dc with provenance "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments":
the snap standard deduction 48 states dc of a household is an amount if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D
    and the household size of the household is a number N
    and the minimum of N and 6 is a number M
    and the snap standard deduction 48 states dc table for M is the amount.

rule snap_standard_deduction with provenance "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments":
the snap standard deduction of a household is an amount if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D
    and the snap standard deduction 48 states dc of the household is the amount.

rule snap_maximum_excess_shelter_deduction_48_states_dc with provenance "USDA SNAP FY 2024 cost-of-living adjustments":
the snap maximum excess shelter deduction 48 states dc is 672 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2023-10-01 <= D.

